  "raw_text": "PLAN \"1-Week Deload Block\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary strength:\n    name \"1-week deload following 4 weeks high-volume hypertrophy; reduce volume and intensity while maintaining technique\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Phase 0 Deload\" (1 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Deload Session A\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 3x5 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          bent_over_row 3x5 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          overhead_press 3x5 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 5 minutes\n      DAY Tuesday training 40m \"Deload Session B\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x5 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          deadlift 2x5 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x6 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hip_flexor_stretch 4 minutes\n      DAY Wednesday rest\n      DAY Thursday training 40m \"Deload Session C\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          incline_press 3x5 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 3x6 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          dips 2x6 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 4 minutes\n      DAY Friday training 40m \"Deload Session D\":\n        warmup:\n          jump_rope 3 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_press 3x5 rpe 5 rest 120 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x6 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          calf_raise 3x8 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 4 minutes\n      DAY Saturday Sunday rest",
